/S /P
/P 946 0 R
/E (K-Prototypes and LPA run at the same time, independently. Both methods find the same three groups. Their agreement score is 0.880, which is very high. The two methods match on 93 to 98 percent of people. One technical flag comes up about how distance is calculated on mixed data, but the other validation checks confirm the three groups are real. There's also a hint that one of the three groups might split into two later, worth watching in the next survey. For now, three groups hold. You approve.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
