2023 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 960 0 R
/E (The Narrator writes the persona for the Unsupported Strivers. Entry-level Sales employees, less than a year on the job, who feel overlooked. This isn't anger. It's neglect. They don't believe the organization sees them or invests in them, and they don't feel informed about where the company is headed. Their own words: "Pay has not kept up. I feel replaceable." "I don't know what the company's plan is. I'm not sure anyone does." "I don't feel valued. My manager is overloaded and I rarely get feedback." The signal is flight risk. They need early intervention. Quality grade is C, so the persona comes with a caution label. Every claim ties back to the data or a real quote. You review. You note the caveat. You approve.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [1]
>>
